<main class="content" id="quarto-document-content">

<header id="title-block-header" class="quarto-title-block default">
<div class="quarto-title">
<h1 class="title">desugar</h1>
</div>
<div class="quarto-title-meta">
</div>

</header>


<p>The structural desugaring contract (bd-7gqr148v, GH #846): what the qmd
reader turns into a <code>Table</code>, <code>DefinitionList</code> or <code>Figure</code> must come out
the same when an lmd cell builds the shape from nodes, writes it inside
a fragment, or reads it back from JSON.</p>
<section id="literal-list-table-control" class="section level2">
<h2>1. Literal list-table (control)</h2>
<table class="caption-top table">
<thead>
<tr class="header">
<th>Key
</th>
<th>Value
</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="odd">
<td><code>a</code>
</td>
<td>one
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</section>
<section id="list-table-div-built-from-ast-nodes-in-a-cell" class="section level2">
<h2>2. list-table div built from AST nodes in a cell</h2>
<div class="list-table">
<ul>
<li><ul>
<li>Key</li>
<li>Value</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><ul>
<li><code>b</code></li>
<li>two</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="literal-definition-list-control" class="section level2">
<h2>3. Literal definition-list (control)</h2>
<dl>
<dt>Term</dt>
<dd>
A definition.
</dd>
</dl>
</section>
<section id="definition-list-div-built-from-ast-nodes-in-a-cell" class="section level2">
<h2>4. definition-list div built from AST nodes in a cell</h2>
<div class="definition-list">
<ul>
<li>Term
<ul>
<li>A definition.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="list-table-inside-a-fragment" class="section level2">
<h2>5. list-table inside a fragment</h2>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold">
<pre class="lmd code-with-copy"><code>return {=:
::: {.list-table}
* - Key
  - Value
* - `c`
  - three
:::
:=}</code></pre>
<button title="Copy to Clipboard" class="code-copy-button" aria-label="Copy code"><i class="bi"></i></button>
</div>
</section>
<section id="pipe-table-inside-a-fragment" class="section level2">
<h2>6. Pipe table inside a fragment</h2>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold">
<pre class="lmd code-with-copy"><code>return {=:
| Key | Value |
|-----|------:|
| `d` | four  |
:=}</code></pre>
<button title="Copy to Clipboard" class="code-copy-button" aria-label="Copy code"><i class="bi"></i></button>
</div>
</section>
<section id="definition-list-inside-a-fragment" class="section level2">
<h2>7. definition-list inside a fragment</h2>
<dl>
<dt>Term</dt>
<dd>
A definition.
</dd>
</dl>
</section>
<section id="single-image-paragraph-built-from-nodes" class="section level2">
<h2>8. Single-image paragraph built from nodes</h2>
<p><img src="pixel.png" alt="A pixel" id="fig-pixel" class="img-fluid" /></p>
</section>
